public, including rehearsal studios, costumes and production workshops.</div></p><div class="sc-4ax36u-6 eEvpNP"><div class="rr0sk1-0 jlkaFB"></div></div><div class="sc-4ax36u-7 hgKGFt"></div><div class="sc-4ax36u-8 jIopBJ"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-roh="ResultItem-58088" class="sc-4ax36u-1 gfQzYw"><div data-roh="EventCard-ResultItem-58088" itemscope="" itemType="http://schema.org/TheaterEvent" class="wqwmzk-16 sc-4ax36u-0 dgthZZ ehwdYH"><div class="wqwmzk-17 kOyvMi"><div class="wqwmzk-18 leBZRn"><picture data-roh="ResultItem-58088Img" alt="" role="presentation"><source media="only screen and (max-width: 699px)" srcSet="https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/ZxJQkoF3NbkBXtxO_Children%27sNutcrackerAdventuretour%C2%A92023VeronikaWard.jpg?auto=format,compress&amp;rect=89,0,1423,1067&amp;w=460&amp;h=345"/><img src="https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/ZxJQkoF3NbkBXtxO_Children%27sNutcrackerAdventuretour%C2%A92023VeronikaWard.jpg?auto=format,compress&amp;rect=89,0,1423,1067&amp;w=960&amp;h=720" alt="A man in a patterned coat stands with arms outstretched, addressing a seated group of adults and children in an open indoor space. The group appears engaged, sitting on a wooden floor with tables and chairs in the background."/></picture></div></div><div class="wqwmzk-17 izjGg"><div class="sc-4ax36u-2 hUKFxV"><div class="sc-4ax36u-3 hqerdh"><ul class="wqwmzk-81 ccnCgF"><li><p class="typography-module_bodycopy__-BY2U typography-module_bodycopy--medium__cwJEu typography-module_bodycopy--inherit__CoC-f">Royal Opera House</p></li><li><p class="typography-module_bodycopy__-BY2U typography-module_bodycopy--medium__cwJEu typography-module_bodycopy--inherit__CoC-f">Tours</p></li></ul></div><h2 class="typography-module_header__FVsLI typography-module_header--medium__OgzlB typography-module_header--inherit__qmHQE">Children&#x27;s Alice in Wonderland Adventure Tour</h2><div class="sc-4ax36u-4 jxfXSA"><p class="typography-module_subtitle__x3sSn typography-module_subtitle--large__1Ep9J typography-module_subtitle--inherit__mly-X"><div data-roh="ResultItem-58088" class="hi3fs3-0 eRPrjb"><span data-roh="eventStartDate" itemProp="startDate">25</span><span data-roh="eventEndDate" itemProp="endDate">–<!-- -->27 October 2026</span></div></p></div><p class="typography-module_bodycopy__-BY2U typography-module_bodycopy--large__BNzf2 typography-module_bodycopy--inherit__CoC-f"><div class="sc-4ax36u-5 cOKjDb">Get ready to tumble down the rabbit hole and explore the curious world of Alice’s Adventures in Wonderland. For children ages 5-11 years old.</div></p><div class="sc-4ax36u-6 eEvpNP"><div class="rr0sk1-0 jlkaFB"></div></div><div class="sc-4ax36u-7 hgKGFt"></div><div class="sc-4ax36u-8 jIopBJ"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-roh="ResultItem-53538" class="sc-4ax36u-1 gfQzYw"><div data-roh="EventCard-ResultItem-53538" itemscope="" itemType="http://schema.org/TheaterEvent" class="wqwmzk-16 sc-4ax36u-0 dgthZZ ehwdYH"><div class="wqwmzk-17 kOyvMi"><div class="wqwmzk-18 leBZRn"><picture data-roh="ResultItem-53538Img" alt="" role="presentation"><source media="only screen and (max-width: 699px)" srcSet="https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aGz2yEMqNJQqHq0K_Swan-Lake-afternoon-tea-%C2%A92025-Eleonora-Boscarelli.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=416%2C0%2C6652%2C4989&amp;w=460&amp;h=345"/><img src="https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aGz2yEMqNJQqHq0K_Swan-Lake-afternoon-tea-%C2%A92025-Eleonora-Boscarelli.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=294%2C0%2C6652%2C4989&amp;w=960&amp;h=720" alt=""/></picture></div></div><div class="wqwmzk-17 izjGg"><div class="sc-4ax36u-2 hUKFxV"><div class="sc-4ax36u-3 hqerdh"><ul class="wqwmzk-81 ccnCgF"><li><p class="typography-module_bodycopy__-BY2U typography-module_bodycopy--medium__cwJEu typography-module_bodycopy--inherit__CoC-f">Royal Opera House</p></li></ul></div><h2 class="typography-module_header__FVsLI typography-module_header--medium__OgzlB typography-module_header--inherit__qmHQE">Tea and Tour</h2><div class="sc-4ax36u-4 jxfXSA"><p class="typography-module_subtitle__x3sSn typography-module_subtitle--large__1Ep9J typography-module_subtitle--inherit__mly-X"><div data-roh="ResultItem-53538" class="hi3fs3-0 eRPrjb"><span data-roh="eventStartDate" itemProp="startDate">25 October</span><span data-roh="eventEndDate" itemProp="endDate">–<!-- -->20 December 2026</span></div></p></div><p class="typography-module_bodycopy__-BY2U typography-module_bodycopy--large__BNzf2 typography-module_bodycopy--inherit__CoC-f"><div class="sc-4ax36u-5 cOKjDb">Journey behind the scenes and delve into the history of Swan Lake on this ballet-themed tour, complete with a delicious afternoon tea.</div></p><div class="sc-4ax36u-6 eEvpNP"><div class="rr0sk1-0 jlkaFB"></div></div><div class="sc-4ax36u-7 hgKGFt"></div><div class="sc-4ax36u-8 jIopBJ"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-roh="ResultItem-37699" class="sc-4ax36u-1 gfQzYw"><div data-roh="EventCard-ResultItem-37699" itemscope="" itemType="http://schema.org/TheaterEvent" class="wqwmzk-16 sc-4ax36u-0 dgthZZ ehwdYH"><div class="wqwmzk-17 kOyvMi"><div class="wqwmzk-18 leBZRn"><picture data-roh="ResultItem-37699Img" alt="" role="presentation"><source media="only screen and (max-width: 699px)" srcSet="https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/plk9rwS3IoL9g7Mi_JetteParkerArtists2025.avif?auto=format,compress&amp;rect=0,0,1024,768&amp;w=960&amp;h=720"/><img src="https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/plk9rwS3IoL9g7Mi_JetteParkerArtists2025.avif?auto=format,compress&amp;rect=0,0,1024,768&amp;w=960&amp;h=720" alt="group of people pose sitting or standing in a rustic studio space wearing bright and colourful clothing. They are members of The Jette Parker Artists Programme at The Royal Opera House."/></picture></div></div><div class="wqwmzk-17 izjGg"><div class="sc-4ax36u-2 hUKFxV"><div class="sc-4ax36u-3 hqerdh"><ul class="wqwmzk-81 ccnCgF"><li><p class="typography-module_bodycopy__-BY2U typography-module_bodycopy--medium__cwJEu typography-module_bodycopy--inherit__CoC-f">Crush Room</p></li><li><p class="typography-module_bodycopy__-BY2U typography-module_bodycopy--medium__cwJEu typography-module_bodycopy--inherit__CoC-f">Opera and music</p></li></ul></div><h2 class="typography-module_header__FVsLI typography-module_header--medium__OgzlB typography-module_header--inherit__qmHQE">Recitals at Lunch</h2><div class="sc-4ax36u-4 jxfXSA"><p class="typography-module_subtitle__x3sSn typography-module_subtitle--large__1Ep9J typography-module_subtitle--inherit__mly-X"><div data-roh="ResultItem-37699" class="hi3fs3-0 eRPrjb"><span data-roh="eventStartDate" itemProp="startDate">26 October 2026</span><span data-roh="eventEndDate" itemProp="endDate">–<!-- -->26 April 2027</span></div></p></div><p class="typography-module_bodycopy__-BY2U typography-module_bodycopy--large__BNzf2 typography-module_bodycopy--inherit__CoC-f"><div class="sc-4ax36u-5 cOKjDb">Join us for an exciting programme of performances curated by our musicians in the intimate setting of the historic Royal Opera House Crush Room.</div></p><div class="sc-4ax36u-6 eEvpNP"><div class="rr0sk1-0 jlkaFB"></div></div><div class="sc-4ax36u-7 hgKGFt"></div><div class="sc-4ax36u-8 jIopBJ"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-roh="ResultItem-52255" class="sc-4ax36u-1 gfQzYw"><div data-roh="EventCard-ResultItem-52255" itemscope="" itemType="http://schema.org/TheaterEvent" class="wqwmzk-16 sc-4ax36u-0 dgthZZ ehwdYH"><div class="wqwmzk-17 kOyvMi"><div class="wqwmzk-18 leBZRn"><picture data-roh="ResultItem-52255Img" alt="" role="presentation"><source media="only screen and (max-width: 699px)" srcSet="https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/1d41d8fc-1baf-4f4c-9ba7-e7336263ac92_The+Bridge+of+Aspiration+linking+the+Royal+Opera+House+and+the+Royal+Ballet+School+%C2%A9+2017+Ashley+Ezrachie.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;rect=90,0,1423,1067&amp;w=460&amp;h=345"/><img src="https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/1d41d8fc-1baf-4f4c-9ba7-e7336263ac92_The+Bridge+of+Aspiration+linking+the+Royal+Opera+House+and+the+Royal+Ballet+School+%C2%A9+2017+Ashley+Ezrachie.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;rect=89,0,1423,1067&amp;w=960&amp;h=720" alt="The Bridge of Aspiration linking the Royal Opera House and the Royal Ballet School"/></picture></div></div><div class="wqwmzk-17 izjGg"><div class="sc-4ax36u-2 hUKFxV"><div class="sc-4ax36u-3 hqerdh"><ul class="wqwmzk-81 ccnCgF"><li><p class="typography-module_bodycopy__-BY2U typography-module_bodycopy--medium__cwJEu typography-module_bodycopy--inherit__CoC-f">Royal Opera House</p></li><li><p class="typography-module_bodycopy__-BY2U typography-module_bodycopy--medium__cwJEu typography-module_bodycopy--inherit__CoC-f">Tours</p></li></ul></div><h2 class="typography-module_header__FVsLI typography-module_header--medium__OgzlB typography-module_header--inherit__qmHQE">Architecture Tour</h2><div class="sc-4ax36u-4 jxfXSA"><p class="typography-module_subtitle__x3sSn typography-module_subtitle--large__1Ep9J typography-module_subtitle--inherit__mly-X"><div data-roh="ResultItem-52255" class="hi3fs3-0 eRPrjb"><span data-roh="eventStartDate" itemProp="startDate">26 October</span><span data-roh="eventEndDate" itemProp="endDate">–<!-- -->17 December 2026</span></div></p></div><p class="typography-module_bodycopy__-BY2U typography-module_bodycopy--large__BNzf2 typography-module_bodycopy--inherit__CoC-f"><div class="sc-4ax36u-5 cOKjDb">Learn about the architecture of our world-famous Victorian theatre and its transformation over the centuries.</div></p><div class="sc-4ax36u-6 eEvpNP"><div class="rr0sk1-0 jlkaFB"></div></div><div class="sc-4ax36u-7 hgKGFt"></div><div class="sc-4ax36u-8 jIopBJ"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-roh="ResultItem-30681" class="sc-4ax36u-1 gfQzYw"><div data-roh="EventCard-ResultItem-30681" itemscope="" itemType="http://schema.org/TheaterEvent" class="wqwmzk-16 sc-4ax36u-0 dgthZZ ehwdYH"><div class="wqwmzk-17 kOyvMi"><div class="wqwmzk-18 leBZRn"><pictu