y-module_bodycopy--inherit__CoC-f"><div class="sc-4ax36u-5 cOKjDb">Royal Ballet and Opera Friends have the opportunity to purchase tickets to open rehearsals.</div></p><div class="sc-4ax36u-6 eEvpNP"><div class="rr0sk1-0 jlkaFB"></div></div><div class="sc-4ax36u-7 hgKGFt"></div><div class="sc-4ax36u-8 jIopBJ"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-roh="ResultItem-79721" class="sc-4ax36u-1 gfQzYw"><div data-roh="EventCard-ResultItem-79721" itemscope="" itemType="http://schema.org/TheaterEvent" class="wqwmzk-16 sc-4ax36u-0 dgthZZ ehwdYH"><div class="wqwmzk-17 kOyvMi"><div class="wqwmzk-18 leBZRn"><picture data-roh="ResultItem-79721Img" alt="" role="presentation"><source media="only screen and (max-width: 699px)" srcSet="https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/HvrZEOqJjUll0gIB_FamilySunday20June2019-c-ROH%2C2018.PhotographbyDaniellePatrick-16-.jpeg?auto=format,compress&amp;rect=256,0,4096,3072&amp;w=960&amp;h=720"/><img src="https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/HvrZEOqJjUll0gIB_FamilySunday20June2019-c-ROH%2C2018.PhotographbyDaniellePatrick-16-.jpeg?auto=format,compress&amp;rect=256,0,4096,3072&amp;w=960&amp;h=720" alt=""/></picture></div></div><div class="wqwmzk-17 izjGg"><div class="sc-4ax36u-2 hUKFxV"><div class="sc-4ax36u-3 hqerdh"><ul class="wqwmzk-81 ccnCgF"><li><p class="typography-module_bodycopy__-BY2U typography-module_bodycopy--medium__cwJEu typography-module_bodycopy--inherit__CoC-f">Multiple venues</p></li><li><p class="typography-module_bodycopy__-BY2U typography-module_bodycopy--medium__cwJEu typography-module_bodycopy--inherit__CoC-f">Workshops and activities</p></li></ul></div><h2 class="typography-module_header__FVsLI typography-module_header--medium__OgzlB typography-module_header--inherit__qmHQE">Barbie | Royal Ballet Craft Activities</h2><div class="sc-4ax36u-4 jxfXSA"><p class="typography-module_subtitle__x3sSn typography-module_subtitle--large__1Ep9J typography-module_subtitle--inherit__mly-X"><div data-roh="ResultItem-79721" class="h