c.io/royal-opera-house/aOzn2Z5xUNkB14oi_veronikaward-roh-tour-2023-82.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=333%2C0%2C5333%2C4000&w=460&h=345","thumbPath":null,"altText":"A man in a patterned coat stands with arms outstretched, addressing a group of adults and children in an open indoor space. The group appears engaged, copying the man's action on a red carpeted floor with doors in the background.","caption":null},"imageResult":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aOzn2Z5xUNkB14oi_veronikaward-roh-tour-2023-82.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C0%2C5333%2C4000&w=960&h=720","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aOzn2Z5xUNkB14oi_veronikaward-roh-tour-2023-82.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=333%2C0%2C5333%2C4000&w=460&h=345","thumbPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aOzn2Z5xUNkB14oi_veronikaward-roh-tour-2023-82.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=333%2C0%2C5333%2C4000&w=460&h=345","altText":"A man in a patterned coat stands with arms outstretched, addressing a group of adults and children in an open indoor space. The group appears engaged, copying the man's action on a red carpeted floor with doors in the background.","caption":null},"dateFieldOverride":null,"description":"<p>Children and adults alike can enjoy learning about and experiencing the behind-the-scenes magic that brings The Nutcracker to life on our stage.</p>","carouselDescription":"<p>Get ready for an enchanting and playful journey through the (paper!) snow to the imaginary land of the sweets, as you explore the world of The Nutcracker. For children ages 5-11 years old.</p>","productionPageUrl":null,"slug":"childrens-the-nutcracker-adventure-tour","performances":[{"date":"2026-12-13T11:30:00+00:00","performanceType":"guided-tour"},{"date":"2026-12-18T11:30:00+00:00","performanceType":"guided-tour"},{"date":"2026-12-18T13:30:00+00:00","performanceType":"guided-tour"},{"date":"2026-12-20T11:30:00+00:00","performanceType":"guided-tour"},{"date":"2026-12-20T13