t=369,0,5587,4190&w=960&h=720","thumbPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/N2xzD81es21k8IMw_MixedProgramme-RB-31-05-19-ROH-2222.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=369,0,5587,4190&w=960&h=720","altText":"Two dancers perform on stage, behind them is a backdrop with a woodlands and fields. The man wears a blue tunic with pattered trousers, the woman a flowing white dress.","caption":null},"dateFieldOverride":null,"description":"<p>Frederick Ashton reimagines Ivan Turgenev&#39;s play in this elegant ballet depicting the drama of a household disrupted and the longing of love unfulfilled, danced to intimate piano music by Chopin.</p>","carouselDescription":"<p>Frederick Ashton reimagines Ivan Turgenev&#39;s play in this elegant ballet depicting the drama of a household disrupted and the longing of love unfulfilled, danced to intimate piano music by Chopin.</p>","productionPageUrl":"/production/a-month-in-the-country-frederick-ashton","slug":"a-month-in-the-country-frederick-ashton","performances":[],"isCancelled":false,"ctaBehaviour":null,"cinemaBroadcastLink":{"validUntil":null,"url":null},"startTime":null,"endTime":null,"isHiddenFromTicketsAndEvents":false,"helpInformation":null,"tags":[],"bookingSeasons":[],"locations":[],"performanceTimes":[],"onSaleDates":[],"runs":[],"festival":null},{"id":"70894","sourceType":"single-production-page","title":"Silver Sunday Tours Coffee morning","imageTray":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aLbPPmGNHVfTOhLQ_ROH2021%3A22SeasonOpening%C2%A92021ROH.PhotographbyJamesBellorini.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=59,0,1481,1111&w=1280&h=960","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aLbPPmGNHVfTOhLQ_ROH2021%3A22SeasonOpening%C2%A92021ROH.PhotographbyJamesBellorini.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=59,0,1481,1111&w=1280&h=960","thumbPath":null,"altText":null,"caption":null},"imageResult":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aLbPPmGNHVfTOhLQ_ROH2021%3A22SeasonOpening%C2%A92021ROH.PhotographbyJamesBellorini.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=59,0,1481,1111&w=960&h=720","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aLbPPmGNHVfTOhLQ_ROH2021%3A22SeasonOpening%C2%A92021ROH.PhotographbyJamesBellorini.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=59,0,1481,1111&w=960&h=720","thumbPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aLbPPmGNHVfTOhLQ_ROH2021%3A22SeasonOpening%C2%A92021ROH.PhotographbyJamesBellorini.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=59,0,1481,1111&w=960&h=720","altText":null,"caption":null},"dateFieldOverride":null,"description":"<p>Enjoy a relaxed morning at the Royal Opera House, beginning with tea or coffee in our café, followed by a behind-the-scenes tour. Discover the stories behind iconic costumes and props, explore our historic theatre at your own pace and enjoy warm conversation in a welcoming, accessible environment.</p>","carouselDescription":"<p>Join us for a relaxed Silver Sunday morning at the Royal Opera House with tea, conversation and a behind-the-scenes tour for guests aged 60 and over.</p>","productionPageUrl":"/production/adapted-tours","slug":"adapted-tours","performances":[],"isCancelled":false,"ctaBehaviour":null,"cinemaBroadcastLink":{"validUntil":null,"url":null},"startTime":null,"endTime":null,"isHiddenFromTicketsAndEvents":true,"helpInformation":{"copy":"<p>Enjoy a relaxed morning at the Royal Opera House, beginning with tea or coffee in our café, followed by a behind-the-scenes tour. Discover the stories behind iconic costumes and props, explore our historic theatre at your own pace and enjoy warm conversation in a welcoming, accessible environment.</p>","link":null},"tags":[],"bookingSeasons":[],"locations":[],"performanceTimes":[],"onSaleDates":[],"runs":[],"festival":null},{"id":"43562","sourceType":"single-production-page","title":"Aida","imageTray":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aarOfVxvIZEnjaYt_HERO_AIDA_2627_Aida-22-09-22-ROH-5915.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=73,0,4296,3222&w=1280&h=960","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aarOfVxvIZEnjaYt_HERO_AIDA_2627_Aida-22-09-22-ROH-5915.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=73,0,4296,3222&w=1280&h=960","thumbPath":null,"altText":"A performer wearing a long jacket is embraced from behind by another. They both stare down at a small fire atop a memorial stone. ","caption":null},"imageResult":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aarOfVxvIZEnjaYt_HERO_AIDA_2627_Aida-22-09-22-ROH-5915.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=73,0,4296,3222&w=960&h=720","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aarOfVxvIZEnjaYt_HERO_AIDA_2627_Aida-22-09-22-ROH-5915.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=73,0,4296,3222&w=960&h=720","thumbPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aarOfVxvIZEnjaYt_HERO_AIDA_2627_Aida-22-09-22-ROH-5915.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=73,0,4296,3222&w=960&h=720","altText":"A performer wearing a long jacket is embraced from behind by another. They both stare down at a small fire atop a memorial stone. ","caption":null},"dateFieldOverride":null,"description":"<p>Love and duty collide as nations clash. Verdi’s sharply relevant opera of love and war returns, with Angel Blue and Ivan Gyngazov as the doomed lovers. Michele Mariotti conducts. </p>","carouselDescription":"<p>Love and duty collide as nations clash in Verdi’s powerful and seductive opera. </p>","productionPageUrl":"/production/aida-robert-carsen","slug":"aida-robert-carsen","performances":[{"date":"2027-05-19T19:00:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-05-23T15:00:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-05-26T19:15:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-05-29T13:00:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-06-01T19:15:00+01:00","performanceType":"young-roh"},{"date":"2027-06-04T19:15:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-06-07T19:15:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-06-09T19:15:00+01:00","performanceType":"standa