obbins","sourceType":"single-production-page","title":"Dances at a Gathering","imageTray":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aal7m1xvIZEnjW5W_HERO_VISIONARY_HM2021-Dancers-at-a-Gathering-03.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=107,0,4287,3215&w=1280&h=960","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aal7m1xvIZEnjW5W_HERO_VISIONARY_HM2021-Dancers-at-a-Gathering-03.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=107,0,4287,3215&w=1280&h=960","thumbPath":null,"altText":"Three ballet dancers perform together wearing light coloured dresses in front of a blue backdrop on a stage. ","caption":null},"imageResult":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aal7m1xvIZEnjW5W_HERO_VISIONARY_HM2021-Dancers-at-a-Gathering-03.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=107,0,4287,3215&w=960&h=720","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aal7m1xvIZEnjW5W_HERO_VISIONARY_HM2021-Dancers-at-a-Gathering-03.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=107,0,4287,3215&w=960&h=720","thumbPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aal7m1xvIZEnjW5W_HERO_VISIONARY_HM2021-Dancers-at-a-Gathering-03.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=107,0,4287,3215&w=960&h=720","altText":"Three ballet dancers perform together wearing light coloured dresses in front of a blue backdrop on a stage. ","caption":null},"dateFieldOverride":null,"description":"<p>Set to some of Fryderyk Chopin’s most familiar piano melodies, Jerome Robbins’s buoyant choreography from 1969 underpins a series of plotless dances, each a portrait of human connection and together a joyful kaleidoscope of shifting moods.</p>","carouselDescription":"<p>Set to some of Fryderyk Chopin’s most familiar piano melodies, Jerome Robbins’s buoyant choreography from 1969 underpins a series of plotless dances, each a portrait of human connection and together a joyful kaleidoscope of shifting moods.</p>","productionPageUrl":"/production/dances-at-a-gathering-jerome-robbins","slug":"dances-at-a-gathering-jerome-robbins","performances":[],"isCancelled":false,"ctaBehaviour":null,"cinemaBroadcastLink":{"validUntil":null,"url":null},"startTime":null,"endTime":null,"isHiddenFromTicketsAndEvents":false,"helpInformation":null,"tags":[],"bookingSeasons":[],"locations":[],"performanceTimes":[],"onSaleDates":[],"runs":[],"festival":null},{"id":"daphnis-and-chloe-frederick-ashton","sourceType":"single-production-page","title":"Daphnis and Chloë","imageTray":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aal8_1xvIZEnjW6r_LANDMARKS_AlexanderCampbellandAnnaRoseO%27SullivaninDaphnisandChloe%2CphotobyAndrejUspenskiROH.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,3794,2846&w=1280&h=960","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aal8_1xvIZEnjW6r_LANDMARKS_AlexanderCampbellandAnnaRoseO%27SullivaninDaphnisandChloe%2CphotobyAndrejUspenskiROH.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,3794,2846&w=1280&h=960","thumbPath":null,"altText":"Two ballet dancers lie in a passionate embrace on the floor of a stage with a dark background. ","caption":null},"imageResult":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aal8_1xvIZEnjW6r_LANDMARKS_AlexanderCampbellandAnnaRoseO%27SullivaninDaphnisandChloe%2CphotobyAndrejUspenskiROH.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,3794,2846&w=960&h=720","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aal8_1xvIZEnjW6r_LANDMARKS_AlexanderCampbellandAnnaRoseO%27SullivaninDaphnisandChloe%2CphotobyAndrejUspenskiROH.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,3794,2846&w=960&h=720","thumbPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aal8_1xvIZEnjW6r_LANDMARKS_AlexanderCampbellandAnnaRoseO%27SullivaninDaphnisandChloe%2CphotobyAndrejUspenskiROH.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,3794,2846&w=960&h=720","altText":"Two ballet dancers lie in a passionate embrace on the floor of a stage with a dark background. ","caption":null},"dateFieldOverride":null,"description":"<p>Inspired by the sublime sensuality of Maurice Ravel’s orchestral work of the same name, Ashton turned to narrative in <em>Daphnis and Chloë. </em>This 1951 ballet abounding in pastoral charm recounts the mythical Greek romance between a goatherd and a shepherdess. </p>","carouselDescription":"<p>Inspired by the sublime sensuality of Maurice Ravel’s orchestral work of the same name, Ashton turned to narrative in <em>Daphnis and Chloë. </em>This 1951 ballet abounding in pastoral charm recounts the mythical Greek romance between a goatherd and a shepherdess. </p>","productionPageUrl":"/production/daphnis-and-chloe-frederick-ashton","slug":"daphnis-and-chloe-frederick-ashton","performances":[],"isCancelled":false,"ctaBehaviour":null,"cinemaBroadcastLink":{"validUntil":null,"url":null},"startTime":null,"endTime":null,"isHiddenFromTicketsAndEvents":false,"helpInformation":null,"tags":[],"bookingSeasons":[],"locations":[],"performanceTimes":[],"onSaleDates":[],"runs":[],"festival":null},{"id":"77648","sourceType":"single-production-page","title":"Dark Nights","imageTray":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/ajFeIY1P9HI4Uk7q_Untitled-21.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,971,6762,5072&w=1280&h=960","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/ajFeIY1P9HI4Uk7q_Untitled-21.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,971,6762,5072&w=1280&h=960","thumbPath":null,"altText":null,"caption":null},"imageResult":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/ajFeIY1P9HI4Uk7q_Untitled-21.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,971,6762,5072&w=960&h=720","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/ajFeIY1P9HI4Uk7q_Untitled-21.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,971,6762,5072&w=960&h=720","thumbPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/ajFeIY1P9HI4Uk7q_Untitled-21.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,971,6762,5072&w=960&h=720","altText":null,"caption":null},"dateFieldOverride":null,"description":"<p>A series of one-off performances on the Linbury Stage by the most innovative and extraordinary vocal artists and experimental composers.</p>","carouselDescription"