description":"<p>Director Barrie Kosky joins forces with Music Director of The Royal Opera Jakub Hrůša for the first chapter of Wagner&#39;s epic <em>Ring</em> cycle.</p>","carouselDescription":"<p>Director Barrie Kosky joins forces with Music Director of The Royal Opera Jakub Hrůša for the first chapter of Wagner&#39;s epic <em>Ring</em> cycle.</p>","productionPageUrl":"/production/das-rheingold-barrie-kosky","slug":"das-rheingold-barrie-kosky","performances":[],"isCancelled":false,"ctaBehaviour":null,"cinemaBroadcastLink":{"validUntil":null,"url":null},"startTime":null,"endTime":null,"isHiddenFromTicketsAndEvents":false,"helpInformation":null,"tags":[],"bookingSeasons":[],"locations":[],"performanceTimes":[],"onSaleDates":[],"runs":[],"festival":null},{"id":"60391","sourceType":"single-production-page","title":"Die Walküre","imageTray":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/dBoOT_AFsfRNcvkH_die_walkuere_bk_roh_271.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=444,0,7113,5335&w=1280&h=960","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/dBoOT_AFsfRNcvkH_die_walkuere_bk_roh_271.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=444,0,7113,5335&w=1280&h=960","thumbPath":null,"altText":"A group of performers stand on a darkened stage. They stand amongst the charred remains of bodies, behind them stands a large black tree. Smoke rises from the back of the stage.","caption":null},"imageResult":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/dBoOT_AFsfRNcvkH_die_walkuere_bk_roh_271.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=444,0,7113,5335&w=960&h=720","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/dBoOT_AFsfRNcvkH_die_walkuere_bk_roh_271.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=444,0,7113,5335&w=960&h=720","thumbPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/dBoOT_AFsfRNcvkH_die_walkuere_bk_roh_271.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=444,0,7113,5335&w=960&h=720","altText":"A group of performers stand on a darkened stage. They stand amongst the charred remains of bodies, behind them stands a large black tree. Smoke rises from the back of the stage.","caption":null},"dateFieldOverride":null,"description":"<p>Director Barrie Kosky joins forces with Music Director of The Royal Opera Jakub Hrůša for the second chapter of Wagner&#39;s epic <em>Ring</em> cycle.</p>","carouselDescription":"<p>Director Barrie Kosky joins forces with Music Director of The Royal Opera Jakub Hrůša for the second chapter of Wagner&#39;s epic <em>Ring</em> cycle.</p>","productionPageUrl":"/production/die-walkure-barrie-kosky","slug":"die-walkure-barrie-kosky","performances":[],"isCancelled":false,"ctaBehaviour":null,"cinemaBroadcastLink":{"validUntil":null,"url":null},"startTime":null,"endTime":null,"isHiddenFromTicketsAndEvents":false,"helpInformation":null,"tags":[],"bookingSeasons":[],"locations":[],"performanceTimes":[],"onSaleDates":[],"runs":[],"festival":null},{"id":"66804","sourceType":"single-production-page","title":"The Rite of Spring + Duke Bluebeard’s Castle in Concert","imageTray":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aaqzU1xvIZEnjaCC_HERO_BLUEBEARD_2627_JakubHrusaAndFriendsInConcert-RBO-ROH-6815.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=219,0,3963,2972&w=1280&h=960","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aaqzU1xvIZEnjaCC_HERO_BLUEBEARD_2627_JakubHrusaAndFriendsInConcert-RBO-ROH-6815.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=219,0,3963,2972&w=1280&h=960","thumbPath":null,"altText":"Music Director of The Royal Opera, Jakub Hrůša, stands in front of an orchestra in a conductor pit facing the audience.","caption":null},"imageResult":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aaqzU1xvIZEnjaCC_HERO_BLUEBEARD_2627_JakubHrusaAndFriendsInConcert-RBO-ROH-6815.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=219,0,3963,2972&w=960&h=720","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aaqzU1xvIZEnjaCC_HERO_BLUEBEARD_2627_JakubHrusaAndFriendsInConcert-RBO-ROH-6815.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=219,0,3963,2972&w=960&h=720","thumbPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aaqzU1xvIZEnjaCC_HERO_BLUEBEARD_2627_JakubHrusaAndFriendsInConcert-RBO-ROH-6815.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=219,0,3963,2972&w=960&h=720","altText":"Music Director of The Royal Opera, Jakub Hrůša, stands in front of an orchestra in a conductor pit facing the audience.","caption":null},"dateFieldOverride":null,"description":"<p>For one night only, Music Director of The Royal Opera Jakub Hrůša and the Orchestra of the Royal Opera House present a concert of Stravinsky&#39;s scandalous<em> The</em> <em>Rite of Spring </em>and Bartók&#39;s blood-red thriller <em>Duke Bluebeard’s Castle</em>, starring Elīna Garanča and Christian Van Horn. </p>","carouselDescription":"<p>Stravinsky’s scandalous work and Bartók&#39;s blood-red thriller<em> </em>come alive in a one-night-only concert.</p>","productionPageUrl":"/production/duke-bluebeards-castle-the-rite-of-spring-in-concert","slug":"duke-bluebeards-castle-the-rite-of-spring-in-concert","performances":[{"date":"2027-04-02T20:00:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"}],"isCancelled":false,"ctaBehaviour":null,"cinemaBroadcastLink":{"validUntil":null,"url":null},"startTime":"2027-04-02T20:00:00+01:00","endTime":"2027-04-02T20:00:00+01:00","isHiddenFromTicketsAndEvents":false,"helpInformation":null,"tags":["921","1132","1349"],"bookingSeasons":["1002"],"locations":["2"],"performanceTimes":["936"],"onSaleDates":["56acd2c71f4dd81e38737e29bf5e42d9b801b016","89c4fc939ddc25844651aeb528c63c4ef361890f","0558db9dbbbc1a516844d831f451d86397daa44e","4dea8cdd62d70185e3dc2feac037ff9c74e5a36e","4c636a8472121d512d4893830bc48b0d59ee0065","076d9e4636d8c0a604c62daf5f87e02472b4c54d","2f8c1e30683833b6d172dd5f2a643dc2a07c3ec6","727ac4dda2a8242d2100221df9dfcfca7629646a"],"runs":[],"festival":null},{"id":"74793","sourceType":"single-production-page","title":"Disruptors: Tanowitz, Junker, Khan, McGregor","imageTray":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aamskFxvIZEnjX_E_HERO_DISRUPTORS_2627_Encounters-RoyalBallet-19-10-24-RoyalBalletandOpera-2646.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=300,0,4792,3594&w=1280&h=960","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aamskFxvIZEnjX_E_HERO_DISRUPTORS_2627_Encounters-RoyalBallet-19-10-24-RoyalBalletandOpera-2646.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=300,0,4792,3594&w=1280&h=960","thumbPath":null,"altText":"Two Royal Ballet dancers perform on stage wearing monochrome leotards and white shorts. One dancer is in a lunge position supporting the other dancer who leans against them. The stage is stark with a dark backdrop. ","caption":null},"imageResult":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aamskFxvIZEnjX_E_HERO_DISRUPTORS_2627_Encounters-RoyalBallet-19-10-24-RoyalBalletandOpera-2646.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=300,0,4792,3594&w=960&h=720","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aamskFxvIZEnjX_E_HERO_DISRUPTORS_2627_Encounters-RoyalBallet-19-10-24-RoyalBalletandOpera-2646.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=300,0,4792,3594&w=960&h=720","thumbPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aamskFxvIZEnjX_E_HERO_DISRUPTORS_2627_Encounters-RoyalBallet-19-10-24-RoyalBalletandOpera-2646.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=300,0,4792,3594&w=960&h=720","altText":"Two Royal Ballet dancers perform on stage wearing monochrome leotards and white shorts. One dancer is in a lunge position supporting the other dancer who leans against them. The stage is stark with a dark backdrop. ","caption":null},"dateFieldOverride":null,"description":"<p>Think you know ballet? Think again. This mixed programme features Pam Tanowitz’s <em>Or Forevermore, </em>Joshua Junker’s <em>Never Known, </em>Akram Khan&#39;s <em>Hunting a Whisper in the Wind </em>and Wayne McGregor’s <em>Chroma.</em></p>","carouselDescription":"<p>Experience an exhilarating spin on ballet in four genre-defying contemporary works.</p>","productionPageUrl":"/production/disruptors-tanowitz-junker-khan-mcgregor","slug":"disruptors-tanowitz-junker-khan-mcgregor","performances":[{"date":"2027-05-06T19:00:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-05-11T19:30:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-05-14T19:30:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-05-17T19:30:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-05-22T13:00:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-05-22T19:00:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-05-25T19:30:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"}],"isCancelled":false,"ctaBehaviour":null,"cinemaBroadcastLink":{"validUntil":null,"url":null},"startTime":"2027-05-06T19:00:00+01:00","endTime":"2027-05-25T19:30:00+01:00","isHiddenFromTicketsAndEvents":false,"helpInformation":null,"tags":["922","1132"],"bookingSeasons":["1003"],"locations":["2"],"performanceTimes":["936","935"],"onSaleDates":["1a1cfeefffe701439775a4d593771cef551cd995","f1f87d41a0af3ed6612f2f9c44179955f4e73444","5d9e26c017a1af9ae6badc0f02f37bab8839f148","2607eb06cb0958b7ecc27466cc67af3abdd14a6d","4b6b9b66611270a893c7ab5d3f339f27fde3265b","fe65e169102aa1a94b33c3477801b11d9b2d66e5","d9be1177100c0e1dadc711332de33fb93a692b18","4b1619e892a74bfdd88f7b53635a2cb3eefb42b2"],"runs":[],"festival":null},{"id":"duke-bluebeards-castle-bela-bartok","sourceType":"single-production-page","title":"Duke Bluebeard’s Castle ","imageTray":{"desktopPath":null,"mobilePath":null,"thumbPath":null,"altText":null,"caption":null},"imageResult":{"desktopPath":null,"mobilePath":null,"thumbPath":null,"altText":null,"caption":null},"dateFieldOverride":null,"description":"<p>&#39;Are you frightened?&#39; Though her new husband instructs her not to open the doors to his castle, Judith is insistent. </p>","carouselDescription":"<p>&#39;Are you frightened?&#39; Though her new husband instructs her not to open the doors to his castle, Judith is insistent. </p>","productionPageUrl":"/production/duke-bluebeards-castle-bela-bartok","slug":"duke-bluebeards-castle-bela-bartok","performances":[],"isCancelled":false,