;s <em>Raymonda Act III.</em></p>","carouselDescription":"<p>Radiance, romance and reverie – three heritage works by The Royal Ballet.</p>","productionPageUrl":"/production/heritage-classics","slug":"heritage-classics","performances":[{"date":"2027-06-17T19:30:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-06-19T13:00:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-06-19T19:00:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-06-24T19:30:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-06-28T19:30:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-06-30T19:30:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-07-03T13:00:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-07-03T19:00:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"}],"isCancelled":false,"ctaBehaviour":null,"cinemaBroadcastLink":{"validUntil":null,"url":null},"startTime":"2027-06-17T19:30:00+01:00","endTime":"2027-07-03T19:00:00+01:00","isHiddenFromTicketsAndEvents":false,"helpInformation":null,"tags":["922","1132"],"bookingSeasons":["1003"],"locations":["2"],"performanceTimes":[],"onSaleDates":["1a1cfeefffe701439775a4d593771cef551cd995","f1f87d41a0af3ed6612f2f9c44179955f4e73444","5d9e26c017a1af9ae6badc0f02f37bab8839f148","2607eb06cb0958b7ecc27466cc67af3abdd14a6d","4b6b9b66611270a893c7ab5d3f339f27fde3265b","fe65e169102aa1a94b33c3477801b11d9b2d66e5","d9be1177100c0e1dadc711332de33fb93a692b18","4b1619e892a74bfdd88f7b53635a2cb3eefb42b2"],"runs":[],"festival":null},{"id":"39564","sourceType":"single-production-page","title":"Elektra","imageTray":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aaryAlxvIZEnja7L_HERO_ELEKTRA_2627_Elektra-09-01-24-ROH-5500.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C0%2C3839%2C2879&w=1280&h=960","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aaryAlxvIZEnja7L_HERO_ELEKTRA_2627_Elektra-09-01-24-ROH-5500.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C0%2C3839%2C2879&w=1280&h=960","thumbPath":null,"altText":"A performer wearing a black and white maids uniform holds the head up of a lifeless-looking performer wearing a purple dress.","caption":null},"imageResult":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aaryAlxvIZEnja7L_HERO_ELEKTRA_2627_Elektra-09-01-24-ROH-5500.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C0%2C3839%2C2879&w=960&h=720","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aaryAlxvIZEnja7L_HERO_ELEKTRA_2627_Elektra-09-01-24-ROH-5500.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C0%2C3839%2C2879&w=960&h=720","thumbPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aaryAlxvIZEnja7L_HERO_ELEKTRA_2627_Elektra-09-01-24-ROH-5500.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C0%2C3839%2C2879&w=960&h=720","altText":"A performer wearing a black and white maids uniform holds the head up of a lifeless-looking performer wearing a purple dress.","caption":null},"dateFieldOverride":null,"description":"<p>Grief turns into a violent quest for revenge. Christof Loy’s nuanced contemporary production returns for its first revival since its 2024 premiere, with Ausrine Stundyte in the murderous title role. Conductor Semyon Bychkov draws out the fierce drama of Strauss’s menacingly modern music. </p>","carouselDescription":"<p>Richard Strauss’s audacious adaptation of an iconic Greek tragedy.</p>","productionPageUrl":"/production/elektra-christof-loy","slug":"elektra-christof-loy","performances":[{"date":"2027-07-12T19:30:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-07-15T20:00:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-07-17T19:30:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-07-21T19:30:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-07-24T19:30:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"}],"isCancelled":false,"ctaBehaviour":null,"cinemaBroadcastLink":{"validUntil":null,"url":null},"startTime":"2027-07-12T19:30:00+01:00","endTime":"2027-07-24T19:30:00+01:00","isHiddenFromTicketsAndEvents":false,"helpInformation":null,"tags":["606","921","1132","934","1063","1064","312","1138"],"bookingSeasons":["1003"