ltText":"A group of performers stand alongside a door frame in a room with flowered wallpaper on stage. A performer wearing a suit has come through the door and holds onto the handle. ","caption":null},"dateFieldOverride":null,"description":"<p>Richard Jones directs the hilarious, final instalment of Puccini’s trio of operas, <em>Il trittico</em>.</p>","carouselDescription":"<p>Richard Jones directs the hilarious, final instalment of Puccini’s trio of operas, <em>Il trittico</em>.</p>","productionPageUrl":"/production/gianni-schicchi-richard-jones","slug":"gianni-schicchi-richard-jones","performances":[],"isCancelled":false,"ctaBehaviour":null,"cinemaBroadcastLink":{"validUntil":null,"url":null},"startTime":null,"endTime":null,"isHiddenFromTicketsAndEvents":false,"helpInformation":null,"tags":[],"bookingSeasons":[],"locations":[],"performanceTimes":[],"onSaleDates":[],"runs":[],"festival":null},{"id":"74710","sourceType":"single-production-page","title":"Hercules","imageTray":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aarQRVxvIZEnjaaV_HERO_HERCULES_2627_hercules_kob_182.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=459,0,7339,5504&w=1280&h=960","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aarQRVxvIZEnjaaV_HERO_HERCULES_2627_hercules_kob_182.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=459,0,7339,5504&w=1280&h=960","thumbPath":null,"altText":"A performer whose makeup and costume is designed to make them look like a statue sits on a purple sofa on stage. Next to them sits another performer with long hair wearing a check shirt. Around them are a group of people reaching out towards the performer in the check shirt, as the statue seems to be ignored. ","caption":null},"imageResult":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aarQRVxvIZEnjaaV_HERO_HERCULES_2627_hercules_kob_182.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=459,0,7339,5504&w=960&h=720","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aarQRVxvIZEnjaaV_HERO_HERCULES_2627_hercules_kob_182.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=459,0,7339,5504&w=960&h=720","thumbPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aarQRVxvIZEnjaaV_HERO_HERCULES_2627_hercules_kob_182.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=459,0,7339,5504&w=960&h=720","altText":"A performer whose makeup and costume is designed to make them look like a statue sits on a purple sofa on stage. Next to them sits another performer with long hair wearing a check shirt. Around them are a group of people reaching out towards the performer in the check shirt, as the statue seems to be ignored. ","caption":null},"dateFieldOverride":null,"description":"<p>Human weakness. Divine destruction. The Royal Opera&#39;s Handel series continues with Barrie Kosky&#39;s new production. Laurence Cummings conducts Anthony Robin Schneider, Paula Murrihy, Mingjie Lei, Mary Bevan and Avery Amereau.</p>","carouselDescription":"<p>In love, there are no heroes. Barrie Kosky directs Handel&#39;s mythological masterpiece.</p>","productionPageUrl":"/production/hercules-barrie-kosky","slug":"hercules-barrie-kosky","performances":[{"date":"2027-06-18T18:30:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-06-21T18:45:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-06-25T18:45:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-06-29T18:45:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-07-01T18:45:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-07-07T18:45:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-07-09T18:45:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"}],"isCancelled":false,"ctaBehaviour":null,"cinemaBroadcastLink":{"validUntil":null,"url":null},"startTime":"2027-06-18T18:30:00+01:00","endTime":"2027-07-09T18:45:00+01:00","isHiddenFromTicketsAndEvents":false,"helpInformation":null,"tags":["921","1132"],"bookingSeasons":["1003"],"locations":["2"],"performanceTimes":["936"],"onSaleDates":["1a1cfeefffe701439775a4d593771cef551cd995","f1f87d41a0af3ed6612f2f9c44179955f4e73444","5d9e26c017a1af9ae6badc0f02f37bab8839f148","2607eb0