er-in-the-wind-akram-khan","performances":[],"isCancelled":false,"ctaBehaviour":null,"cinemaBroadcastLink":{"validUntil":null,"url":null},"startTime":null,"endTime":null,"isHiddenFromTicketsAndEvents":false,"helpInformation":null,"tags":[],"bookingSeasons":[],"locations":[],"performanceTimes":[],"onSaleDates":[],"runs":[],"festival":null},{"id":"i-would-be-here-if-i-could-the-mirrorbox","sourceType":"single-production-page","title":"I would be here if I could: The Mirrorbox","imageTray":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/IO53CoX2L-Hhz_bF_MirrorboxJourneyGlastonburyTor%2CSomerset-credit_JoLathwood-001.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C1153%2C3024%2C2268&w=1280&h=960","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/IO53CoX2L-Hhz_bF_MirrorboxJourneyGlastonburyTor%2CSomerset-credit_JoLathwood-001.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C1153%2C3024%2C2268&w=1280&h=960","thumbPath":null,"altText":null,"caption":null},"imageResult":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/IO53CoX2L-Hhz_bF_MirrorboxJourneyGlastonburyTor%2CSomerset-credit_JoLathwood-001.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C1098%2C3024%2C2268&w=960&h=720","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/IO53CoX2L-Hhz_bF_MirrorboxJourneyGlastonburyTor%2CSomerset-credit_JoLathwood-001.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C1098%2C3024%2C2268&w=960&h=720","thumbPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/IO53CoX2L-Hhz_bF_MirrorboxJourneyGlastonburyTor%2CSomerset-credit_JoLathwood-001.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C1098%2C3024%2C2268&w=960&h=720","altText":null,"caption":null},"dateFieldOverride":null,"description":"<p>An interactive installation at the Royal Opera House sharing messages from people with ME and Long Covid who can no longer visit places they love. Listen, reflect and leave a postcard in response. A free, interactive experience exploring connection, absence and accessibility.</p>","carouselDescription":"<p>Step inside the Mirrorbox at the Royal Opera House on 12 - 13 September to hear a message from someone who loves this place but can no longer visit. This free interactive sculpture shares messages from people living with ME (Myalgic Encephalomyelitis) and Long Covid, connecting them with places they love but can no longer physically reach.</p>","productionPageUrl":"/production/i-would-be-here-if-i-could-the-mirrorbox","slug":"i-would-be-here-if-i-could-the-mirrorbox","performances":[],"isCancelled":false,"ctaBehaviour":null,"cinemaBroadcastLink":{"validUntil":null,"url":null},"startTime":"2026-09-12T11:00:00+0000","endTime":"2026-09-13T17:00:00+0000","isHiddenFromTicketsAndEvents":false,"helpInformation":{"copy":"<p>Free to attend</p>","link":null},"tags":[],"bookingSeasons":[],"locations":[],"performanceTimes":[],"onSaleDates":[],"runs":[],"festival":null},{"id":"il-tabarro-richard-jones","sourceType":"single-production-page","title":"Il tabarro","imageTray":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aaqwglxvIZEnjZ-p_TRITTICO_2627_%C2%A9BC20160222_IL_TABARRO_36DAVIDJUNGHOONKIMASBALLADSELLER-C-ROH.PHOTOGRAPHERBILLCOOPER.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=165,0,3685,2764&w=1280&h=960","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aaqwglxvIZEnjZ-p_TRITTICO_2627_%C2%A9BC20160222_IL_TABARRO_36DAVIDJUNGHOONKIMASBALLADSELLER-C-ROH.PHOTOGRAPHERBILLCOOPER.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=165,0,3685,2764&w=1280&h=960","thumbPath":null,"altText":"A red bricked house on stage with performers  leaning out of the bottom floor windows looking up towards one performer who sits at the window on the second floor. The stage is dark with lighting coming from inside the house. ","caption":null},"imageResult":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aaqwglxvIZEnjZ-p_TRITTICO_2627_%C2%A9BC20160222_IL_TABARRO_36DAVIDJUNGHOONKIMASBALLADSELLER-C-ROH.PHOTOGRAPHERBILLCOOPER.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=165,0,3685,2764&w=960&h=720","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aaqwglxvIZEnjZ-p_TRITTICO_2627_%C2%A9BC20160222_IL_TABARRO_36DAVIDJUNGHOONKIMASBALLADSELLER-C-ROH.PHOTOGRAPHERBILLCOOPER.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=165,0,3685,2764&w=960&h=720","thumbPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aaqwglxvIZEnjZ-p_TRITTICO_2627_%C2%A9BC20160222_IL_TABARRO_36DAVIDJUNGHOONKIMASBALLADSELLER-C-ROH.PHOTOGRAPHERBILLCOOPER.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=165,0,3685,2764&w=960&h=720","altText":"A red bricked house on stage with performers  leaning out of the bottom floor windows looking up towards one performer who sits at the window on the second floor. The stage is dark with lighting coming from inside the house. ","caption":null},"dateFieldOverride":null,"description":"<p>Passions run high in Puccini’s taut melodrama of infidelity and murder, set on the banks of the river Seine.</p>","carouselDescription":"<p>Passions run high in Puccini’s taut melodrama of infidelity and murder, set on the banks of the river Seine.</p>","productionPageUrl":"/production/il-tabarro-richard-jones","slug":"il-tabarro-richard-jones","performances":[],"isCancelled":false,"ctaBehaviour":null,"cinemaBroadcastLink":{"validUntil":null,"url":null},"startTime":null,"endTime":null,"isHiddenFromTicketsAndEvents":false,"helpInformation":null,"tags":[],"bookingSeasons":[],"locations":[],"performanceTimes":[],"onSaleDates":[],"runs":[],"festival":null},{"id":"37699","sourceType":"single-production-page","title":"Recitals at Lunch","imageTray":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/plk9rwS3IoL9g7Mi_JetteParkerArtists2025.avif?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,1024,768&w=1280&h=960","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/plk9rwS3IoL9g7Mi_JetteParkerArtists2025.avif?auto=format,compress&rect=0,0,1024,768&w=1280&h=960","thumbPath":null,"altText":"group of people pose sitting or standing in a rustic studio space wearing bright and colourful clothing. They are members of The Jette Parker Artists Programme at The Royal Opera