rect=1785,0,5429,4072&w=960&h=720","altText":"9 ballet dancers perform on stage within 9 brightly lit circular spotlights. All the dancers stand on one foot with their other stretched out. ","caption":null},"dateFieldOverride":null,"description":"<p>Kammerballetten, the refreshing Danish dance company at the forefront of contemporary dance, present <em>Stay Tuned</em>, a collection of chamber ballets by Sol León and Paul Lightfoot. In the intimate space of the Linbury Theatre, immerse in pure movement and music which come together in a poetic performance of artistry and contemplation.  </p>","carouselDescription":"<p>The refreshing Danish dance company Kammerballetten make their Linbury debut with chamber ballets by Sol León and Paul Lightfoot </p>","productionPageUrl":"/production/stay-tuned-kammerballeten","slug":"stay-tuned-kammerballeten","performances":[{"date":"2026-12-11T19:45:00+00:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2026-12-12T19:45:00+00:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2026-12-13T15:30:00+00:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2026-12-14T19:45:00+00:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2026-12-16T19:45:00+00:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2026-12-17T19:45:00+00:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2026-12-18T19:45:00+00:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2026-12-19T19:45:00+00:00","performanceType":"standard"}],"isCancelled":false,"ctaBehaviour":null,"cinemaBroadcastLink":{"validUntil":null,"url":null},"startTime":"2026-12-11T19:45:00+00:00","endTime":"2026-12-19T19:45:00+00:00","isHiddenFromTicketsAndEvents":false,"helpInformation":null,"tags":["922","1132","1349"],"bookingSeasons":["1001"],"locations":["73"],"performanceTimes":["936","935"],"onSaleDates":["1000ad5d978cdf1d2d9ed35a98915f049d5d5fcf","0558db9dbbbc1a516844d831f451d86397daa44e","5bfadc563bf9dfdf372cb06d772d287200e9a0b2","aa2d1537623290d7573a8dcca7caa5ef2d7c6b78","3a0bc3ec709efed904801f5433e3fb31029a519e","d79204d0ef8c691f2403c3ef25c74e58b557bc25","e2aca631972f28b09d3ac444027a5cdc6ed5fb7a","49718da6df662870fa691bfd3d21454d9f8fe1d2"],"runs":[],"festival":null},{"id":"2231","sourceType":"single-production-page","title":"The Magic Flute","imageTray":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aanBrVxvIZEnjYTI_HERO_FLUTE_2627_300TuuliTakalaasQueenoftheNightinTheMagicFlute-C-ROH2019.PhotographedbyTristramKenton.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=320,0,4104,3078&w=1280&h=960","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aanBrVxvIZEnjYTI_HERO_FLUTE_2627_300TuuliTakalaasQueenoftheNightinTheMagicFlute-C-ROH2019.PhotographedbyTristramKenton.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=320,0,4104,3078&w=1280&h=960","thumbPath":null,"altText":"The opera singer Tuuli Takala wears a black ballgown and a medieval style headdress and stands in front of a backdrop painted like an astrological sky. She holds her arms outwards as she sings. She is performing as Queen of the Night in The Royal Opera's production of The Magic Flute. ","caption":null},"imageResult":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aanBrVxvIZEnjYTI_HERO_FLUTE_2627_300TuuliTakalaasQueenoftheNightinTheMagicFlute-C-ROH2019.PhotographedbyTristramKenton.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=320,0,4104,3078&w=960&h=720","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aanBrVxvIZEnjYTI_HERO_FLUTE_2627_300TuuliTakalaasQueenoftheNightinTheMagicFlute-C-ROH2019.PhotographedbyTristramKenton.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=320,0,4104,3078&w=960&h=720","thumbPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aanBrVxvIZEnjYTI_HERO_FLUTE_2627_300TuuliTakalaasQueenoftheNightinTheMagicFlute-C-ROH2019.PhotographedbyTristramKenton.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=320,0,4104,3078&w=960&h=720","altText":"The opera singer Tuuli Takala wears a black ballgown and a medieval style headdress and stands in front of a backdrop painted like an astrological sky. She holds her arms outwards as she sings. She is performing as Queen of the Night in The Royal Opera's production of The Magic Flute. ","caption":null},"dateFieldOverride":null,"description":"<p>An enchanting musical quest for love and freedom.<strong> </strong>Dalia Stasevska, Julia Jones, Susanna Stranders and Richard Hetherington conduct two exciting casts in David McVicar’s five-star production of Mozart’s beloved family-favourite opera. </p>","carouselDescription":"<p>Embark on a fantastical adventure for all the family.</p>","productionPageUrl":"/production/the-magic-flute-david-mcvicar","slug":"the-magic-flute-david-mcvicar","performances":[{"date":"2026-12-13T15:00:00+00:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2026-12-17T19:15:00+00:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2026-12-30T12:00:00+00:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-01-01T19:00:00+00:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-01-06T19:15:00+00:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-01-08T12:00:00+00:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-01-14T19:15:00+00:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-01-16T19:00:00+00:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-01-19T11:30:00+00:00","performanceType":"schools-matinee"},{"date":"2027-01-23T19:15:00+00:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-02-06T19:15:00+00:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-02-09T19:15:00+00:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-02-11T19:15:00+00:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-02-14T15:00:00+00:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-02-17T19:15:00+00:00","performanceType":"standard"}],"isCancelled":false,"ctaBehaviour":null,"cinemaBroadcastLink":{"validUntil":null,"url":null},"startTime":"2026-12-13T15:00:00+00:00","endTime":"2027-02-17T19:15:00+00:00","isHiddenFromTicketsAndEvents":false,"helpInformation":null,"tags":["921","1132","1349","312","934","993","1063","1064","928","1217","1229"],"bookingSeasons":["1001"],"locations":["2"],"performanceTimes":["936","935"],"onSaleDates":["1000ad5d978cdf1d2d9ed35a98915f049