bilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aal8_lxvIZEnjW6q_HERO_LANDMARKS_AshtonMixedBill-17-10-14-RoyalBallet-1876.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=444,0,5113,3835&w=1280&h=960","thumbPath":null,"altText":"Several ballet dancers perform on stage, all are wearing white costumes. They perform in front of a yellow and green gradient backdrop with flowing geometric patterns.","caption":null},"imageResult":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aal8_lxvIZEnjW6q_HERO_LANDMARKS_AshtonMixedBill-17-10-14-RoyalBallet-1876.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=444,0,5113,3835&w=960&h=720","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aal8_lxvIZEnjW6q_HERO_LANDMARKS_AshtonMixedBill-17-10-14-RoyalBallet-1876.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=444,0,5113,3835&w=960&h=720","thumbPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aal8_lxvIZEnjW6q_HERO_LANDMARKS_AshtonMixedBill-17-10-14-RoyalBallet-1876.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=444,0,5113,3835&w=960&h=720","altText":"Several ballet dancers perform on stage, all are wearing white costumes. They perform in front of a yellow and green gradient backdrop with flowing geometric patterns.","caption":null},"dateFieldOverride":null,"description":"<p>Three milestone works created over three decades – experience the choreographic imagination of Frederick Ashton. This mixed programme comprises <em>Les Rendezvous, Symphonic Variations </em>and <em>Daphnis and Chloë. </em> </p>","carouselDescription":"<p>Delightful encounters. The beauty of form. A mythical love story – three works from British ballet’s master craftsman.</p>","productionPageUrl":"/production/landmarks-unmissable-ashton","slug":"landmarks-unmissable-ashton","performances":[{"date":"2027-01-25T19:30:00+00:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-01-26T19:30:00+00:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-02-13T13:00:00+00:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-02-13T19:00:00+00:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027