mat,compress&rect=442,0,7081,5311&w=960&h=720","thumbPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/adklv51ZCF7ETF2R_NetiaJones2026B.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=442,0,7081,5311&w=960&h=720","altText":"A black and white headshot of a person wearing a black jacket and black high necked jumper. It is a headshot of the Associate Director of The Royal Opera, Netia Jones. ","caption":null},"dateFieldOverride":null,"description":"<p>Join cast and creatives of Netia Jones’s new <em>Così fan tutte </em>production to learn more about the inspirations and themes behind this modern take on Mozart’s opera.</p>","carouselDescription":"<p>Join cast and creatives behind <em>Così fan tutte</em> and learn about the inspirations, themes and this modern reimagining of Mozart&#39;s opera, directed by Netia Jones. </p>","productionPageUrl":"/production/insights-cosi-fan-tutte","slug":"insights-cosi-fan-tutte","performances":[{"date":"2027-01-26T19:45:00+00:00","performanceType":"landp-insights"}],"isCancelled":false,"ctaBehaviour":null,"cinemaBroadcastLink":{"validUntil":null,"url":null},"startTime":"2027-01-26T19:45:00+00:00","endTime":"2027-01-26T19:45:00+00:00","isHiddenFromTicketsAndEvents":false,"helpInformation":null,"tags":["585","924","1349"],"bookingSeasons":["1002"],"locations":["76"],"performanceTimes":["936"],"onSaleDates":["56acd2c71f4dd81e38737e29bf5e42d9b801b016","89c4fc939ddc25844651aeb528c63c4ef361890f","0558db9dbbbc1a516844d831f451d86397daa44e","4dea8cdd62d70185e3dc2feac037ff9c74e5a36e","4c636a8472121d512d4893830bc48b0d59ee0065","076d9e4636d8c0a604c62daf5f87e02472b4c54d","2f8c1e30683833b6d172dd5f2a643dc2a07c3ec6","727ac4dda2a8242d2100221df9dfcfca7629646a"],"runs":[],"festival":null},{"id":"75451","sourceType":"single-production-page","title":"Once more to this star ","imageTray":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aar3TlxvIZEnja_z_HERO_TANOWITZ_2627_20260128_RBO_Rehearsal_5208_Final.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,171,6863,5147&w=1280&h=960