sts. </p>","productionPageUrl":"/production/jette-parker-artists-summer-performance-27","slug":"jette-parker-artists-summer-performance-27","performances":[],"isCancelled":false,"ctaBehaviour":null,"cinemaBroadcastLink":{"validUntil":null,"url":null},"startTime":"2027-07-25T18:00:00+0000","endTime":"2027-07-25T21:00:00+0000","isHiddenFromTicketsAndEvents":false,"helpInformation":null,"tags":[],"bookingSeasons":[],"locations":[],"performanceTimes":[],"onSaleDates":[],"runs":[],"festival":null},{"id":"36708","sourceType":"single-production-page","title":"Káťa Kabanová","imageTray":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aaqyelxvIZEnjaAk_HERO_KATYA_2627_0909AmandaMajeskiasKatyaKabanova-c-ROH2019photographbyCliveBarda-2.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=471,0,6144,4608&w=1280&h=960","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aaqyelxvIZEnjaAk_HERO_KATYA_2627_0909AmandaMajeskiasKatyaKabanova-c-ROH2019photographbyCliveBarda-2.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=471,0,6144,4608&w=1280&h=960","thumbPath":null,"altText":"A performer wearing a beige dress is lit from above on stage and stands in front of a park bench with a beige coat strewn across. They are in movement as though running towards the audience. Behind them, only slightly visible, are a group of performers.","caption":null},"imageResult":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aaqyelxvIZEnjaAk_HERO_KATYA_2627_0909AmandaMajeskiasKatyaKabanova-c-ROH2019photographbyCliveBarda-2.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=471,0,6144,4608&w=960&h=720","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aaqyelxvIZEnjaAk_HERO_KATYA_2627_0909AmandaMajeskiasKatyaKabanova-c-ROH2019photographbyCliveBarda-2.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=471,0,6144,4608&w=960&h=720","thumbPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aaqyelxvIZEnjaAk_HERO_KATYA_2627_0909AmandaMajeskiasKatyaKabanova-c-ROH2019photographbyCliveBarda-2.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=471,0,6144,4608&w=960&h=720","altText":"A performer wearing a beige dress is lit from above on stage and stands in front of a park bench with a beige coat strewn across. They are in movement as though running towards the audience. Behind them, only slightly visible, are a group of performers.","caption":null},"dateFieldOverride":null,"description":"<p>A storm of longing. Richard Jones’s intimate, stripped-back staging beautifully realises Janáček’s opera of yearning and destruction, which stars Corinne Winters. Jakub Hrůša draws out the expressive lines of the Czech composer’s score, which is infused with traditional folk melodies of his – and Hrůša’s – home country. </p>","carouselDescription":"<p>A young and vulnerable woman is swept up in a passionate affair in Janáček’s evocative opera.</p>","productionPageUrl":"/production/kata-kabanova-richard-jones","slug":"kata-kabanova-richard-jones","performances":[{"date":"2027-03-22T19:30:00+00:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-03-24T19:30:00+00:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-03-30T19:30:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-04-01T19:30:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-04-07T19:30:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-04-10T19:30:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"}],"isCancelled":false,"ctaBehaviour":null,"cinemaBroadcastLink":{"validUntil":null,"url":null},"startTime":"2027-03-22T19:30:00+00:00","endTime":"2027-04-10T19:30:00+01:00","isHiddenFromTicketsAndEvents":false,"helpInformation":null,"tags":["921","993","1132","1349","934","1063","1064","312","1138"],"bookingSeasons":["1002"],"locations":["2"],"performanceTimes":["936"],"onSaleDates":["56acd2c71f4dd81e38737e29bf5e42d9b801b016","89c4fc939ddc25844651aeb528c63c4ef361890f","0558db9dbbbc1a516844d831f451d86397daa44e","4dea8cdd62d70185e3dc2feac037ff9c74e5a36e","4c636a8472121d512d4893830bc48b0d59ee0065","076d9e4636d8c0a604c62daf5f87e02472b4c54d","2f8c1e30683833b6d172dd5f2a643dc2a07c3ec6","727ac4dda2a8242d2100221df9dfcfca7629646a"],"runs":[],"festival":null},{"id":"74711","sourceType":"single-production-page","title":"La Gioconda","imageTray":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aarNP1xvIZEnjaXA_HERO_GIOCONDA_2627_Gioconda_062-2.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=194,0,3088,2316&w=1280&h=960","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aarNP1xvIZEnjaXA_HERO_GIOCONDA_2627_Gioconda_062-2.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=194,0,3088,2316&w=1280&h=960","thumbPath":null,"altText":"A performer wears a gold sequin tassled dress, a warm-coloured fur coat, black sunglasses and holds a rosary in her left hand. She stands against a stark concrete backdrop with her shadow visibly larger than her. ","caption":null},"imageResult":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aarNP1xvIZEnjaXA_HERO_GIOCONDA_2627_Gioconda_062-2.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=194,0,3088,2316&w=960&h=720","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aarNP1xvIZEnjaXA_HERO_GIOCONDA_2627_Gioconda_062-2.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=194,0,3088,2316&w=960&h=720","thumbPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aarNP1xvIZEnjaXA_HERO_GIOCONDA_2627_Gioconda_062-2.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=194,0,3088,2316&w=960&h=720","altText":"A performer wears a gold sequin tassled dress, a warm-coloured fur coat, black sunglasses and holds a rosary in her left hand. She stands against a stark concrete backdrop with her shadow visibly larger than her. ","caption":null},"dateFieldOverride":null,"description":"<p>Raised in poverty, street singer Gioconda has always craved security. But now she craves something more. Oliver Mears&#39;s new staging transports the action to modern-day Venice. Antonio Pappano conducts a star cast including Anna Netrebko and Stefan Pop. </p>","carouselDescription":"<p>One woman’s love will push her to the limit, in Amilcare Ponchielli&#39;s grand opera.</p>","productionPageUrl":"/production/la-gioconda-oliver-mears","slug":"la-gioconda-oliver-mears","