9BlxvIZEnjW6y_LANDMARKS_FrederickAshtonCelebrated-06-06-24-LesRendezvous-RoyalBallet-ROH-623.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=199%2C0%2C2891%2C2168&w=960&h=720","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aal9BlxvIZEnjW6y_LANDMARKS_FrederickAshtonCelebrated-06-06-24-LesRendezvous-RoyalBallet-ROH-623.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=199%2C0%2C2891%2C2168&w=960&h=720","thumbPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aal9BlxvIZEnjW6y_LANDMARKS_FrederickAshtonCelebrated-06-06-24-LesRendezvous-RoyalBallet-ROH-623.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=199%2C0%2C2891%2C2168&w=960&h=720","altText":"Four ballet dancers wearing yellow dresses with flowers in their hair perform together in the centre of a stage. They perform in front of an ornate gate with a painterly rural background.","caption":null},"dateFieldOverride":null,"description":"<p><em>Les Rendezvous </em>is<em> </em>a delightful succession of dances following a group of friends who meet in the park. Created in 1933, this was Ashton’s first major ballet for the Vic-Wells company.</p>","carouselDescription":"<p><em>Les Rendezvous </em>is<em> </em>a delightful succession of dances following a group of friends who meet in the park. Created in 1933, this was Ashton’s first major ballet for the Vic-Wells company.</p>","productionPageUrl":"/production/les-rendezvous-frederick-ashton","slug":"les-rendezvous-frederick-ashton","performances":[],"isCancelled":false,"ctaBehaviour":null,"cinemaBroadcastLink":{"validUntil":null,"url":null},"startTime":null,"endTime":null,"isHiddenFromTicketsAndEvents":false,"helpInformation":null,"tags":[],"bookingSeasons":[],"locations":[],"performanceTimes":[],"onSaleDates":[],"runs":[],"festival":null},{"id":"33884","sourceType":"single-production-page","title":"Swan Lake","imageTray":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aammxFxvIZEnjXxJ_HERO_SWANLAKE_2627_DSC01888.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=250,0,4000,3000&w=1280&h=960","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aammxFxvIZEnjXxJ_HERO_SWANLAKE_2627_DSC01888.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=250,0,4000,3000&w=1280&h=960","thumbPath":null,"altText":"The Royal Ballet dancer Fumi Kaneko wears a white tutu and feathered headdress stands en pointe. She is embraced from behind by The Royal Ballet dancer Vadim Muntagirov who is wearing a black soldiers uniform. Slightly blurred from view, behind the two dancers, are a group of ballet dancers wearing the same white tutus and feathered headdresses. They are performing in The Royal Ballet's production of Swan Lake.","caption":null},"imageResult":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aammxFxvIZEnjXxJ_HERO_SWANLAKE_2627_DSC01888.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=250,0,4000,3000&w=960&h=720","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aammxFxvIZEnjXxJ_HERO_SWANLAKE_2627_DSC01888.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=250,0,4000,3000&w=960&h=720","thumbPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aammxFxvIZEnjXxJ_HERO_SWANLAKE_2627_DSC01888.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=250,0,4000,3000&w=960&h=720","altText":"The Royal Ballet dancer Fumi Kaneko wears a white tutu and feathered headdress stands en pointe. She is embraced from behind by The Royal Ballet dancer Vadim Muntagirov who is wearing a black soldiers uniform. Slightly blurred from view, behind the two dancers, are a group of ballet dancers wearing the same white tutus and feathered headdresses. They are performing in The Royal Ballet's production of Swan Lake.","caption":null},"dateFieldOverride":null,"description":"<p>A princess cursed. A prince deceived. A love immortal. Classical ballet&#39;s most powerful story returns in Liam Scarlett’s spectacular production for The Royal Ballet, bringing together Tchaikovsky’s towering score and John Macfarlane’s picturesque designs. </p>","carouselDescription":"<p>A bewitching tale of sorcery and love. The ultimate ballet classic.</p>","productionPageUrl":"/production/swan-lake-marius-petip