er in a white dress stands in the middle and slightly in front. The other two dancers wear dark outfits.","caption":null},"imageResult":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/E0mPX0nsCWsaYVPf_image00001.jpeg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C989%2C5400%2C4050&w=960&h=720","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/E0mPX0nsCWsaYVPf_image00001.jpeg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C989%2C5400%2C4050&w=960&h=720","thumbPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/E0mPX0nsCWsaYVPf_image00001.jpeg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C989%2C5400%2C4050&w=960&h=720","altText":"Three dancers stand on a darkened stage. An orange light shines on them from above. One dancer in a white dress stands in the middle and slightly in front. The other two dancers wear dark outfits.","caption":null},"dateFieldOverride":null,"description":"<p>London City Ballet presents a brand new mixed programme celebrating commissioned new work and heritage revivals. The programme will feature the genius of Kenneth MacMillan, with a work unseen in decades, among other choreographers soon to be announced. </p>","carouselDescription":"<p>The celebrated, recently-revived company returns to the Linbury Theatre.</p>","productionPageUrl":"/production/london-city-ballet-27","slug":"london-city-ballet-27","performances":[{"date":"2027-04-28T19:30:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-04-29T19:30:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-04-30T19:30:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-05-01T14:00:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-05-01T19:30:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-05-02T14:00:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"}],"isCancelled":false,"ctaBehaviour":null,"cinemaBroadcastLink":{"validUntil":null,"url":null},"startTime":"2027-04-28T19:30:00+01:00","endTime":"2027-05-02T14:00:00+01:00","isHiddenFromTicketsAndEvents":false,"helpInformation":null,"tags":["922","1132","1349"],"bookingSeasons":["1002"],"locations":["73"],"performanceTimes":["936","935"],"onSaleDates":["56acd2c71f4dd81e38737e29bf5e42d9b801b016","89c4fc939ddc25844651aeb528c63c4ef361890f","0558db9dbbbc1a516844d831f451d86397daa44e","4dea8cdd62d70185e3dc2feac037ff9c74e5a36e","4c636a8472121d512d4893830bc48b0d59ee0065","076d9e4636d8c0a604c62daf5f87e02472b4c54d","2f8c1e30683833b6d172dd5f2a643dc2a07c3ec6","727ac4dda2a8242d2100221df9dfcfca7629646a"],"runs":[],"festival":null},{"id":"61","sourceType":"single-production-page","title":"Madama Butterfly","imageTray":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aarxHlxvIZEnja6f_HERO_BUTTERFLY_2627_MadamaButterfly-14-06-22-ROH-3302.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=5,0,4216,3162&w=1280&h=960","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aarxHlxvIZEnja6f_HERO_BUTTERFLY_2627_MadamaButterfly-14-06-22-ROH-3302.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=5,0,4216,3162&w=1280&h=960","thumbPath":null,"altText":"A performer wearing a kimono holds a basket in one arm and tends to tall flowers with the other on a well-lit stage with a bright blue backdrop. They are performing in The Royal Opera's production of Madama Butterfly. ","caption":null},"imageResult":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aarxHlxvIZEnja6f_HERO_BUTTERFLY_2627_MadamaButterfly-14-06-22-ROH-3302.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=5,0,4216,3162&w=960&h=720","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aarxHlxvIZEnja6f_HERO_BUTTERFLY_2627_MadamaButterfly-14-06-22-ROH-3302.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=5,0,4216,3162&w=960&h=720","thumbPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aarxHlxvIZEnja6f_HERO_BUTTERFLY_2627_MadamaButterfly-14-06-22-ROH-3302.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=5,0,4216,3162&w=960&h=720","altText":"A performer wearing a kimono holds a basket in one arm and tends to tall flowers with the other on a well-lit stage with a bright blue backdrop. They are performing in The Royal Opera's production of Madama Butterfly. ","caption":null},"dateFieldOverride":null,"description":"<p>Eternal longing for a love lost in Puccini&#39;s devastating opera. A standout triple cast includes Elena Stikhina, Hrachuhí Bassénz and Asmik Grigorian as the innocent and idealistic Cio-Cio-San and Saimir Pirgu, SeokJong Baek and Joshua Guerrero as her callous lover. Henrik Nánási conducts.</p>","carouselDescription":"<p>Puccini&#39;s devastating tale of hope and heartbreak.</p>","productionPageUrl":"/production/madama-butterfly-moshe-leiser-patrice-caurier","slug":"madama-butterfly-moshe-leiser-patrice-caurier","performances":[{"date":"2027-07-04T15:00:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-07-05T11:30:00+01:00","performanceType":"schools-matinee"},{"date":"2027-07-06T19:30:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-07-08T19:30:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-07-10T19:30:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-07-13T19:30:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-07-14T19:30:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-07-16T19:30:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-07-17T12:00:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-07-19T19:30:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-07-20T19:30:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-07-22T19:30:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-07-23T19:30:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"},{"date":"2027-07-24T12:00:00+01:00","performanceType":"standard"}],"isCancelled":false,"ctaBehaviour":null,"cinemaBroadcastLink":{"validUntil":null,"url":null},"startTime":"2027-07-04T15:00:00+01:00","endTime":"2027-07-24T12:00:00+01:00","isHiddenFromTicketsAndEvents":false,"helpInformation":null,"tags":["921","934","1063","1132","1064","585","312","1138","928","1217"],"bookingSeasons":["1003"],"locations":["2"],"performanceTimes":["936","935"],"onSaleDates":["1a1cfeefffe701439775a4d593771cef551cd995","f1f87d41a0af3ed6612f2f9c44179955f4e73444","5d