ion":"<p><em>Never Known </em>is a 2024 work by The Royal Ballet&#39;s Joshua Junker that is by turns slickly hypnotic and deeply stirring. To the intricate electronic sounds of Nils Frahm and Vikingur Ólafsson, dancers move in a mesmeric maze of groups and duets. </p>","productionPageUrl":"/production/never-known-joshua-junker","slug":"never-known-joshua-junker","performances":[],"isCancelled":false,"ctaBehaviour":null,"cinemaBroadcastLink":{"validUntil":null,"url":null},"startTime":null,"endTime":null,"isHiddenFromTicketsAndEvents":false,"helpInformation":null,"tags":[],"bookingSeasons":[],"locations":[],"performanceTimes":[],"onSaleDates":[],"runs":[],"festival":null},{"id":"next-generation-festival-27","sourceType":"single-production-page","title":"Next Generation Festival 2027","imageTray":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aasqDFxvIZEnjbpf_HERO_NEXTGEN_2627_DSC0491.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=160,0,3224,2418&w=1280&h=960","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aasqDFxvIZEnjbpf_HERO_NEXTGEN_2627_DSC0491.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=160,0,3224,2418&w=1280&h=960","thumbPath":null,"altText":"A ballet dancer launches themselves into the air on a dark stage in front of a square shape that is brightly lit red.","caption":null},"imageResult":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aasqDFxvIZEnjbpf_HERO_NEXTGEN_2627_DSC0491.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=159,0,3224,2418&w=960&h=720","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aasqDFxvIZEnjbpf_HERO_NEXTGEN_2627_DSC0491.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=159,0,3224,2418&w=960&h=720","thumbPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aasqDFxvIZEnjbpf_HERO_NEXTGEN_2627_DSC0491.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=159,0,3224,2418&w=960&h=720","altText":"A ballet dancer launches themselves into the air on a dark stage in front of a square shape that is brightly lit red.","caption":null},"dateFieldOverride":null,"description":"<p>The festival will see a diverse range of performing talent as junior companies and dance schools from the UK, across Europe and around the world come together in a series of performances.</p>","carouselDescription":"<p>Discover the future stars of ballet and dance.</p>","productionPageUrl":"/production/next-generation-festival-27","slug":"next-generation-festival-27","performances":[],"isCancelled":false,"ctaBehaviour":null,"cinemaBroadcastLink":{"validUntil":null,"url":null},"startTime":"2027-06-10T23:00:00+0000","endTime":"2027-06-24T23:00:00+0000","isHiddenFromTicketsAndEvents":false,"helpInformation":null,"tags":[],"bookingSeasons":[],"locations":[],"performanceTimes":[],"onSaleDates":[],"runs":[],"festival":null},{"id":"or-forevermore-pam-tanowitz","sourceType":"single-production-page","title":"Or Forevermore","imageTray":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aamskFxvIZEnjX_E_HERO_DISRUPTORS_2627_Encounters-RoyalBallet-19-10-24-RoyalBalletandOpera-2646.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=300%2C0%2C4792%2C3594&w=1280&h=960","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aamskFxvIZEnjX_E_HERO_DISRUPTORS_2627_Encounters-RoyalBallet-19-10-24-RoyalBalletandOpera-2646.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=300%2C0%2C4792%2C3594&w=1280&h=960","thumbPath":null,"altText":"Two Royal Ballet dancers perform on stage wearing monochrome leotards and white shorts. One dancer is in a lunge position supporting the other dancer who leans against them. The stage is stark with a dark backdrop. ","caption":null},"imageResult":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aamskFxvIZEnjX_E_HERO_DISRUPTORS_2627_Encounters-RoyalBallet-19-10-24-RoyalBalletandOpera-2646.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=300,0,4792,3594&w=960&h=720","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aamskFxvIZEnjX_E_HERO_DISRUPTORS_2627_Encounters-RoyalBallet-19-10-24-RoyalBalletandOpera-2646.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=300,0,4792,3594&w=960&h=720","thumbPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aamskFxvIZEnjX_E_HERO_DISRUPTORS_2627_Encounters-RoyalBallet-19-10-24-RoyalBalletandOpera-2646.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=300,0,4792,3594&w=960&h=720","altText":"Two Royal Ballet dancers perform on stage wearing monochrome leotards and white shorts. One dancer is in a lunge position supporting the other dancer who leans against them. The stage is stark with a dark backdrop. ","caption":null},"dateFieldOverride":null,"description":"<p>American choreographer Pam Tanowitz intertwines wit, fun and pathos in <em>Or Forevermore, </em>where the unexpected awaits with every note of Ted Hearne’s multi-textural score. Known for her boundless curiosity and deft subversion of balletic convention, the American choreographer created this work for The Royal Ballet in 2024. </p>","carouselDescription":"<p>American choreographer Pam Tanowitz intertwines wit, fun and pathos in <em>Or Forevermore, </em>where the unexpected awaits with every note of Ted Hearne’s multi-textural score. Known for her boundless curiosity and deft subversion of balletic convention, the American choreographer created this work for The Royal Ballet in 2024. </p>","productionPageUrl":"/production/or-forevermore-pam-tanowitz","slug":"or-forevermore-pam-tanowitz","performances":[],"isCancelled":false,"ctaBehaviour":null,"cinemaBroadcastLink":{"validUntil":null,"url":null},"startTime":null,"endTime":null,"isHiddenFromTicketsAndEvents":false,"helpInformation":null,"tags":[],"bookingSeasons":[],"locations":[],"performanceTimes":[],"onSaleDates":[],"runs":[],"festival":null},{"id":"raymonda-act-iii-rudolf-nureyev","sourceType":"single-production-page","title":"Raymonda Act III","imageTray":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/LhEf84MpduaAkSVb_TripleBill-RoyalBallet-22-10-19-ROH-2508.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=165,0,5443,4082&w=1280&h=960","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/LhEf84MpduaAkSVb_TripleBill-RoyalBallet-22-10-19-ROH-2508.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=165,0,5443,4082&w=1280&h=960","thumbPath":null,"altText":"A group of dancers stand on a set of steps on stage, behind them ornate are ornate archways. They wear decorative formal white outfits and have fur hats with white feathers. ","caption":null},"imageResult":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/LhEf84MpduaAkSVb_TripleBill-RoyalBallet-22-10-19-ROH-2508.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=165,0,5443,4082&w=960&h=720","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/LhEf84MpduaAkSVb_TripleBill-RoyalBallet-22-10-19-ROH-2508.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=165,0,5443,4082&w=960&h=720","thumbPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/LhEf84MpduaAkSVb_TripleBill-RoyalBallet-22-10-19-ROH-2508.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=165,0,5443,4082&w=960&h=720","altText":"A group of dancers stand on a set of steps on stage, behind them ornate are ornate archways. They wear decorative formal white outfits and have fur hats with white feathers. ","caption":null},"dateFieldOverride":null,"description":"<p><em>Raymonda Act III </em>is a magnificent demonstration of solo and group virtuosity, with a ravishing score by Alexander Glazunov and opulent designs by Barry Kay.</p>","carouselDescription":"<p><em>Raymonda Act III </em>is a magnificent demonstration of solo and group virtuosity, with a ravishing score by Alexander Glazunov and opulent designs by Barry Kay.</p>","productionPageUrl":"/production/raymonda-act-iii-rudolf-nureyev","slug":"raymonda-act-iii-rudolf-nureyev","performances":[],"isCancelled":false,"ctaBehaviour":null,"cinemaBroadcastLink":{"validUntil":null,"url":null},"startTime":null,"endTime":null,"isHiddenFromTicketsAndEvents":false,"helpInformation":null,"tags":[],"bookingSeasons":[],"locations":[],"performanceTimes":[],"onSaleDates":[],"runs":[],"festival":null},{"id":"romeo-and-juliet-kenneth-macmillan","sourceType":"single-production-page","title":"Romeo and Juliet","imageTray":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/