:null},"dateFieldOverride":null,"description":"<p>In Puccini’s heartbreaking opera, a young nun is brought face to face with devastating news from her past life.</p>","carouselDescription":"<p>In Puccini’s heartbreaking opera, a young nun is brought face to face with devastating news from her past life.</p>","productionPageUrl":"/production/suor-angelica-richard-jones","slug":"suor-angelica-richard-jones","performances":[],"isCancelled":false,"ctaBehaviour":null,"cinemaBroadcastLink":{"validUntil":null,"url":null},"startTime":null,"endTime":null,"isHiddenFromTicketsAndEvents":false,"helpInformation":null,"tags":[],"bookingSeasons":[],"locations":[],"performanceTimes":[],"onSaleDates":[],"runs":[],"festival":null},{"id":"symphonic-variations-frederick-ashton","sourceType":"single-production-page","title":"Symphonic Variations","imageTray":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/d1a2a8f4-9f76-4f0b-bf37-e48b5c6f66a8_Artists+of+The+Royal+Ballet+in+Symphonic+Variations.+%C2%A9ROH_+2017.+Photographed+by+Tristram+Kenton..jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=245,0,4059,3044&w=1280&h=960","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/d1a2a8f4-9f76-4f0b-bf37-e48b5c6f66a8_Artists+of+The+Royal+Ballet+in+Symphonic+Variations.+%C2%A9ROH_+2017.+Photographed+by+Tristram+Kenton..jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=245,0,4059,3044&w=1280&h=960","thumbPath":null,"altText":null,"caption":null},"imageResult":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/d1a2a8f4-9f76-4f0b-bf37-e48b5c6f66a8_Artists+of+The+Royal+Ballet+in+Symphonic+Variations.+%C2%A9ROH_+2017.+Photographed+by+Tristram+Kenton..jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=245,0,4059,3044&w=960&h=720","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/d1a2a8f4-9f76-4f0b-bf37-e48b5c6f66a8_Artists+of+The+Royal+Ballet+in+Symphonic+Variations.+%C2%A9ROH_+2017.+Photographed+by+Tristram+Kenton..jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=245,0,4059,3044&w=960&h=720","thumbPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/d1a2a8f4-9f76-4f0b-bf37-e48b5c6f66a8_Artists+of+The+Royal+Ballet+in+Symphonic+Variations.+%C2%A9ROH_+2017.+Photographed+by+Tristram+Kenton..jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=245,0,4059,3044&w=960&h=720","altText":null,"caption":null},"dateFieldOverride":null,"description":"<p>The post-war <em>Symphonic Variations </em>(1946)<em> </em>is Ashton&#39;s radiant celebration of ‘pure dance’. Serene in quality and demonstrating an elegant purity in the marriage between movement and music, the ballet remains an indisputable <em>tour de force </em>to this day. </p>","carouselDescription":"<p>The post-war <em>Symphonic Variations </em>(1946)<em> </em>is Ashton&#39;s radiant celebration of ‘pure dance’. Serene in quality and demonstrating an elegant purity in the marriage between movement and music, the ballet remains an indisputable <em>tour de force </em>to this day. </p>","productionPageUrl":"/production/symphonic-variations-frederick-ashton","slug":"symphonic-variations-frederick-ashton","performances":[],"isCancelled":false,"ctaBehaviour":null,"cinemaBroadcastLink":{"validUntil":null,"url":null},"startTime":null,"endTime":null,"isHiddenFromTicketsAndEvents":false,"helpInformation":null,"tags":[],"bookingSeasons":[],"locations":[],"performanceTimes":[],"onSaleDates":[],"runs":[],"festival":null},{"id":"66187","sourceType":"single-production-page","title":"Tosca","imageTray":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aaq5O1xvIZEnjaIA_HERO_TOSCA_2627_ToscaROHBTS-01092.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=293,0,4679,3509&w=1280&h=960","mobilePath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aaq5O1xvIZEnjaIA_HERO_TOSCA_2627_ToscaROHBTS-01092.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=293,0,4679,3509&w=1280&h=960","thumbPath":null,"altText":"An opera singer wearing a green silk dress sings passionately in front of a backdrop of a marble wall. Her shadow is visible. ","caption":null},"imageResult":{"desktopPath":"https://images.prismic.io/royal-opera-house/aaq5O1xvIZEnjaIA_HERO_TOS